      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Camuel owaco bot jo Icrael ducu ni, “Nen, doŋ atyeko winyo dogwu i lok ducu ma wuwaco bota; doŋ amiyowu kabaka me loyowu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koni doŋ wunen, kabaka tye ka telo wiwu. An doŋ ati woko ma wiya ki lwar; dok, wunen, awobena bene gitye kwedwu. Abedo ka tic i nyimwu cakke wa ka tinona o kwede wa onyoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An atye ene, wutit lok ma mako koma i nyim Rwot ki i nyim lakerre ma giwiro ki moo, Aŋa ma akwanyo twonne? Aŋa ma akwanyo kanane? Nyo aŋa ma abumo jamine? Aŋa ma yam aburo? Nyo aŋa ma yam agamo lim me wilo loyo kop ki i ciŋe me laum waŋa? Wutit lok ma mako koma, ci abidwoko waŋe botwu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gugamo ni, “In yam pe ibumo jamiwa mo, kadi burowa, nyo gamo jami mo ki i ciŋ dano mo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ci owaco botgi ni, “Rwot aye lacaden i komwu, ki lakerre ma giwiro ki moo bene aye lacaden tin ma moko ni, pe wunono gin mo i ciŋa.” Gugamo ni, “En aye caden.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.12.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
